Branding for Sparky Stereo OS's build of Waterfox, until BrowserWorks agrees
to anything else. build-in-container.sh copies Mozilla's in-tree
"unofficial" branding (browser/branding/unofficial: generic artwork, no
Mozilla or Waterfox marks) to browser/branding/sparky-stereo, lays these
files over it, and uses Waterfox's own build template for the directory
(waterfox/browser/branding/moz.build and branding-common.mozbuild), which
installs the icon sizes Waterfox's package manifest lists. The name is
provisional and is set here and in the mozconfig only.
